I am back in the office.
I sit at my desk.
I look at my laptop and work on my code.
I am very focused.
Jonas comes over to my desk.
"Do you have a moment, Maya?" he asks.
"I have a question about the software."
"Sure, what is the problem?" I ask.
He shows me the code on the screen.
We look closely at the problem.
We discuss a few ideas and test a solution.
"Maybe the mistake is here?" I say.
I point to a line in the code.
"Ah, exactly!" says Jonas.
"You are right, that is the solution."
We change the code immediately.
Now the software is working well.
Jonas says thank you and goes to his desk.
We are really a good team.
